This project was inspired by CSVMusic(another open source tool to do basically the same thing Accro-Music does).

Launch the app Paste a spotify track url, Playlist url or an album url. chose the bitrate, Format for the song/songs or the volume of the songs/song and some other stuffs.

First released version is "1, 0, 0, 157" with autoupdates already implemented.

